  "idea": "Penpot: the free open-source Figma alternative for design teams",
  "text": "Design user interfaces, prototypes, and graphics collaboratively without paying any seat fees. Design platforms charge premium rates for every viewer who needs to inspect CSS code. This paywall slows down sprints because engineers cannot inspect layout dimensions without paid licenses. Instead, build your systems in Penpot, where developers can inspect CSS grid and flexbox properties for free. You bridge the gap between design and development effortlessly.",
